  "description": "This lovely 2nd floor 2-bedroom/2-bathroom apartment overlooks the beautiful gardens with an abundance of plants and shrubbery.\nunderground car parking for 1 car\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall with storage, a main bathroom, a large bright living room cum dining room with a patio door to a balcony, fully fitted kitchen, 2 double bedrooms with a main ensuite\n\n\nWyckham Point is close to the LUAS Balally station & several bus routes. It is beside the Dundrum exit (Junction 13) of the M50. The city centre is within easy reach, and the Dundrum Shopping Centre is at your front door.\n\nThere is a 24-hour concierge & security for Wyckham Point and also a full gymnasium on site for residents.",
